    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer">
        <tei:div facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg">
          <tei:pb ed="1965" n="2" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg"/>
          <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="17"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/17/6" n="6" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/17/6"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg" n="2"/>I call to Thee, for Thou dost respond to me, O God, incline Thine ear to me, hear my word. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/17/15" n="15" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/17/15"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg" n="2"/>In righteousness may I behold Thy countenance, I am satisfied on waking with Thy likeness. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="31"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/31/15" n="15" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/31/15"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg" n="2"/>I trust in Thee, O Lord, I say, Thou art my God. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="28"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/28/2" n="2" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/28/2"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg" n="2"/>Hear the voice of my prayer when I implore Thee, when I raise my hands toward Thine inmost sanctuary. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="30"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/30/3" n="3" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/30/3"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg" n="2"/>O Lord my God, I implore Thee and Thou healest me. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/30/9" n="9" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/30/9"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg" n="2"/>Unto Thee, O Lord, do I call and my Master do I entreat. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="31"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/31/17" n="17" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/31/17"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg" n="2"/>Let Thy countenance shine upon Thy servant, help me in Thy grace. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="38"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/38/16" n="16" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/38/16"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg" n="2"/>For I wait for Thee, O Lord, Thou dost respond, O Lord my God. <tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="3"/><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="39"/><tei:milestone unit="verse-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/39/13/shimah" n="shimah" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/39/13/shimah"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="3"/>Hear my prayer, O Lord, listen to my entreaty, at my tears do not be silent. <tei:milestone unit="verse-part"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="30"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/30/11" n="11" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/30/11"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="3"/>Hear, O Lord, and be gracious to me, O Lord, be my aid. </tei:p>
          <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="122"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/122/1" n="1" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/122/1"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="3"/>Song of the ascents by David: I am glad when they say to me: Let us go into the House of the Lord. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="119"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/119/162" n="162" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/119/162"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="3"/>I rejoice at Thy word as one who has found abundant booty. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="5"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/5/3" n="3" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/5/3"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="3"/>Listen to the sound of my cry, my King and my God, for to Thee do I pray. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/5/4" n="4" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/5/4"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="3"/>O Lord, in the morning listen to my voice, in the morning I address Thee and I have hope. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/><tei:milestone unit="occurrence" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/siddur/rosh_hashanah/morning_preliminaries/psalm_17_6_repeat" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/morning_preliminaries/psalm_17_6_repeat"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="3"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="17" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/repeat/quote/psalms/17"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="3"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="6" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/repeat/quote/psalms/17/6"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="3"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/17/6">I called to Thee for Thou dost respond to me. O God, incline Thine ear to me, hear my word.</tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/> <tei:milestone unit="occurrence"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="26"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/day_two/morning_occurrences/morning_before_prayer/quote/bible/psalms/26/12" n="12" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/26/12"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="3"/>My foot has stood on level ground. In assemblies will I praise the Lord. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/></tei:p>
        </tei:div>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
